  "description": "GUFCUH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C88 H100 Cl2 Ho4 N8 O18 2+,5(C1 H4 O1),4(C1 H2 Cl2),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.512-3.861 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.70-110.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C98H120Cl12Ho4N8O24. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
